{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"6924ea2e2cc94bd5","__entryId":"collapse","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600\">帮助中心</div>\n      <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin:8px 0 6px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px\" value=\"重置密码\">\n      <div class=\"cpl-sc-item\"><div class=\"cpl-sc-head\">如何重置登录密码？<span class=\"arr\">▾</span></div><div class=\"cpl-sc-body\">进入「账号设置 → 安全」，点击「重置密码」，按邮件里的指引操作即可，全程约 1 分钟。</div></div>\n      <div class=\"cpl-sc-item\"><div class=\"cpl-sc-head\">支持哪些支付方式？<span class=\"arr\">▸</span></div></div>\n      <div class=\"cpl-sc-item\" style=\"border-bottom:none\"><div class=\"cpl-sc-head\">如何申请开发票？<span class=\"arr\">▸</span></div></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px\">通知设置</div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">消息通知</span><label class=\"demo-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">邮件周报</span><label class=\"demo-switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\"><span class=\"track\"></span></label></div>\n      <div class=\"cpl-sc-item\" style=\"border-bottom:none\"><div class=\"cpl-sc-head\" style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">高级设置（免打扰时段、Webhook）<span class=\"arr\">▸</span></div></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">订单 SF1024888</b><span class=\"demo-tag green\">已签收</span></div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);margin-bottom:6px\">