pan></div>\n        <div class=\"cpl-sc-body\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n          <div style=\"display:flex\"><span style=\"flex:1\">Mechanical keyboard ×1</span><span>¥249.00</span></div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex\"><span style=\"flex:1\">Keycap set ×2</span><span>¥80.00</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n      <div style=\"width:180px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <div style=\"height:14px;background:var(--bg-soft);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding:8px 12px 10px\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px\">Settings</div>\n          <div class=\"cpl-sc-item\"><div class=\"cpl-sc-head\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:7px 0\">Account and security<span class=\"arr\">▸</span></div></div>\n          <div class=\"cpl-sc-item\"><div class=\"cpl-sc-head\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:7px 0\">Privacy<span class=\"arr\">▾</span></div><div class=\"cpl-sc-body\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding-bottom:8px\">Who can see my updates<br>Blacklist management</div></div>\n          <div class=\"cpl-sc-item\" style=\"border-bottom:none\"><div class=\"cpl-sc-head\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:7px 0\">About<span class=\"arr\">▸</span></div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"cp-demo\"><span class=\"cp-item\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"head\"><span class=\"cp-head\">如何邀请团队成员？<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"arrow\"><span class=\"cp-arrow\">▾</span></span></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"body\"><span class=\"cp-body\">进入「项目设置 → 成员」，点击“邀请成员”，输入邮箱即可。</span></span></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"cp-demo\"><span class=\"cp-item\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"head\"><span class=\"cp-head\">How to invite team members? <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"arrow\"><span class=\"cp-arrow\">▾</span></span></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"body\"><span class=\"cp-body\">Enter \"Project Settings → Members\", click \"Invite Members\" and enter your email address. </span></span></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"root","cn":"折叠面板","en":"Collapse","desc":"一组可折叠内容的容器","desc_en":"A container for a set of collapsible sections"},{"key":"head","cn":"面板头","en":"Header","desc":"标题行，整块可点击","desc_en":"The title row; the whole row is clickable"},{"key":"arrow","cn":"箭头","en":"Arrow","desc":"指示当前是展开还是收起","desc_en":"Indicates whether the section is expanded or collapsed"},{"key":"body","cn":"面板内容","en":"Content","desc":"展开后才看到的正文","desc_en":"The content revealed after expansion"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"手风琴","en":"Accordion","demo":"<div class=\"cp-demo\"><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">如何邀请团队成员？<span class=\"cp-arrow\">▾</span></div><div class=\"cp-body\">同时只展开一个面板。</div></div><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">支持导出数据吗？<span class=\"cp-arrow\">▸</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"cp-demo\"><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">How to invite team members? <span class=\"cp-arrow\">▾</span></div><div class=\"cp-body\">Expand only one panel at a time. </div></div><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">Does it support exporting data? <span class=\"cp-arrow\">▸</span></div></div></div>","when":"同时只想让一组展开，页面保持短","when_en":"When only one section should expand at a time and the page should stay compact."},{"cn":"简洁无边框","en":"Ghost","demo":"<div class=\"cp-demo cp-ghost\"><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">如何邀请团队成员？<span class=\"cp-arrow\">▾</span></div><div class=\"cp-body\">去掉边框，融进页面背景。</div></div><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">支持导出数据吗？<span class=\"cp-arrow\">▸</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"cp-demo cp-ghost\"><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">How to invite team members? <span class=\"cp-arrow\">▾</span></div><div class=\"cp-body\">Remove the border and blend into the background of the page. </div></div><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">Does it support exporting data? <span class=\"cp-arrow\">▸</span></div></div></div>","when":"想弱化边界、融进页面背景时用","when_en":"When you want a subtler border that blends into the page background."},{"cn":"卡片式","en":"Card","demo":"<div class=\"cp-demo cp-card\"><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">如何邀请团队成员？<span class=\"cp-arrow\">▾</span></div><div class=\"cp-body\">每个面板一张卡片。</div></div><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">支持导出数据吗？<span class=\"cp-arrow\">▸</span></div></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"cp-demo cp-card\"><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">How to invite team members? <span class=\"cp-arrow\">▾</span></div><div class=\"cp-body\">One card per section. </div></div><div class=\"cp-item\"><div class=\"cp-head\">Does it support exporting data? <span class=\"cp-arrow\">▸</span></div></div></div>","when":"每组内容相对独立，想强调分组","when_en":"When each section is independent and grouping needs emphasis."}],"use":[{"t":"<b>FAQ 问答</b>：问题平铺，答案默认收起","m":"collapse-faq"},{"t":"把<b>高级 / 不常用设置</b>收起来，主界面保持清爽","m":"collapse-advanced"},{"t":"内容分组很多，让用户<b>自己决定展开哪组</b>","m":"collapse-groups"},{"t":"<b>移动端页面太长</b>，次要信息折叠起来","m":"collapse-mobile"}],"dont":[{"t":"风险提示和重要公告需要持续可见，不应默认放进折叠面板","m":"collapse-key","bad":true},{"t":"只有<b>一组内容</b>也折叠，会增加不必要的操作","m":"collapse-single","bad":true},{"t":"几组平级内容互斥切换时，使用 {c:tabs} 更合适","m":"tabs-status","bad":true},{"t":"折叠里<b>再套折叠</b>，父级路径被隐藏，难以定位内容","m":"collapse-nested","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"购买页有 20 个常见问题，但“退款申请须在 7 天内提交”会直接影响购买决定。怎样安排？","options":[{"id":"collapse-with-visible-rule","label":"问题答案按需折叠，但把 7 天退款条件放在购买入口附近持续显示","feedback":"折叠能降低次要内容的浏览负担，影响决定的关键条件则不应等待用户主动发现。","correct":true},{"id":"hide-all-details","label":"把所有答案和退款条件都默认收起，只保留 20 个问题标题","feedback":"结构更短却隐藏了关键购买条件，用户可能在没有看到限制时作出决定。","correct":false},{"id":"question-tabs","label":"把 20 个问题做成一排标签页，每次切换后只显示一个答案","feedback":"大量标签难以扫描和换行，也没有解决退款条件需要持续可见的问题。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A purchase page has 20 common questions, but Refund requests must be submitted within 7 days directly affects the decision. How should it be arranged?","options":[{"id":"collapse-with-visible-rule","label":"Collapse answers on demand but keep the seven-day rule visible near the purchase action","feedback":"Collapsing reduces the cost of secondary content, while a decision-critical condition should not depend on discovery.","correct":true},{"id":"hide-all-details","label":"Collapse every answer and refund condition by default and show only the 20 questions","feedback":"The page becomes shorter but hides a key purchase condition, so users may decide without seeing the limit.","correct":false},{"id":"question-tabs","label":"Turn all 20 questions into one row of tabs and show one answer at a time","feedback":"Many tabs are difficult to scan and wrap, and they still fail to keep the refund condition visible.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把 FAQ 答案整理成可展开的折叠面板，但将 7 天退款期限放在价格和购买按钮附近持续显示。标题要能概括答案，并测试键盘展开、收起和移动端长问题换行。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Organize FAQ answers as collapsible panels, but keep the seven-day refund window persistently visible near price and purchase controls. Make each heading summarize its answer, then test keyboard toggling and long mobile question wrapping."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"cpl-live\"><div class=\"cpl-cap\">手风琴 · 同时只展开一个</div><div class=\"cpl-item\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"cplda\" id=\"cpld1\" checked><label class=\"cpl-head\" for=\"cpld1\">如何邀请团队成员？<span class=\"cpl-arrow\">▸</span></label><div class=\"cpl-body\"><span class=\"cpl-in\">进入「项目设置 → 成员」，点击“邀请成员”，输入对方邮箱即可。</span></div></div><div class=\"cpl-item\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"cplda\" id=\"cpld2\"><label class=\"cpl-head\" for=\"cpld2\">支持导出数据吗？<span class=\"cpl-arrow\">▸</span></label><div class=\"cpl-body\"><span class=\"cpl-in\">支持，项目设置里可导出 CSV 或 JSON。</span></div></div><div class=\"cpl-cap\">各自独立 · 想开几个开几个</div><div class=\"cpl-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cpld3\" checked><label class=\"cpl-head\" for=\"cpld3\">如何修改项目名称？<span class=\"cpl-arrow\">▸</span></label><div class=\"cpl-body\"><span class=\"cpl-in\">项目设置 → 基础信息，改完自动保存。</span></div></div><div class=\"cpl-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cpld4\"><label class=\"cpl-head\" for=\"cpld4\">可以设置截止日期吗？<span class=\"cpl-arrow\">▸</span></label><div class=\"cpl-body\"><span class=\"cpl-in\">可以，在项目设置里开启「截止日期」即可。</span></div></div></div>","references":[{"title":"Accordion 手风琴模式","source":"WAI-ARIA APG","url":"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/accordion/","title_en":"Accordion Pattern"}],"scenes":["常见问题 FAQ","高级设置收纳","订单明细展开","移动端长页面"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"cpl-live\"><div class=\"cpl-cap\">Accordion · Expand only one at a time</div><div class=\"cpl-item\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"cplda\" id=\"cpld1\" checked><label class=\"cpl-head\" for=\"cpld1\">How to invite team members? <span class=\"cpl-arrow\">▸</span></label><div class=\"cpl-body\"><span class=\"cpl-in\">Enter \"Project Settings → Members\", click \"Invite Members\" and enter the other party's email address. </span></div></div><div class=\"cpl-item\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"cplda\" id=\"cpld2\"><label class=\"cpl-head\" for=\"cpld2\">Does it support exporting data? <span class=\"cpl-arrow\">▸</span></label><div class=\"cpl-body\"><span class=\"cpl-in\">Yes. You can export CSV or JSON from Project Settings. </span></div></div><div class=\"cpl-cap\">Independent · Open as many as you want</div><div class=\"cpl-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cpld3\" checked><label class=\"cpl-head\" for=\"cpld3\">How to modify the project name? <span class=\"cpl-arrow\">▸</span></label><div class=\"cpl-body\"><span class=\"cpl-in\">Project settings → Basic information, automatically saved after modification. </span></div></div><div class=\"cpl-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"cpld4\"><label class=\"cpl-head\" for=\"cpld4\">Can a deadline be set? <span class=\"cpl-arrow\">▸</span></label><div class=\"cpl-body\"><span class=\"cpl-in\">Yes, just turn on the \"Deadline\" in the project settings. </span></div></div></div>","use":[{"t":"Frequently asked questions","m":"collapse-faq"},{"t":"Advanced settings","m":"collapse-advanced"},{"t":"Long supporting details","m":"collapse-groups"},{"t":"Optional sections in a compact page","m":"collapse-mobile"}],"dont":[{"t":"Hide critical information or a required action","m":"collapse-key","bad":true},{"t":"Nest several levels of collapsible panels","m":"collapse-single","bad":true},{"t":"Make the heading too vague to predict the content","m":"tabs-status","bad":true},{"t":"Collapse everything when most people need it open","m":"collapse-nested","bad":true}],"scenes":["FAQ","Advanced options","Product details","Troubleshooting guide"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600\">Help Center</div>\n      <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin:8px 0 6px;padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px\" value=\"Reset password\">\n      <div class=\"cpl-sc-item\"><div class=\"cpl-sc-head\">How do I reset my password? <span class=\"arr\">▾</span></div><div class=\"cpl-sc-body\">Go to Account Settings → Security, select Reset Password, and follow the instructions in the email. It usually takes about a minute. </div></div>\n      <div class=\"cpl-sc-item\"><div class=\"cpl-sc-head\">What payment methods are supported? <span class=\"arr\">▸</span></div></div>\n      <div class=\"cpl-sc-item\" style=\"border-bottom:none\"><div class=\"cpl-sc-head\">How do I request an invoice? <span class=\"arr\">▸</span></div></div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:400px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-